[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14704.15, "timestamp": "04:05:04", "text": "等级分别是43、46、37、35、40。哇。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14707.189, "timestamp": "04:05:07", "text": "所以，我将成为伤害输出最高的人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14718.79, "timestamp": "04:05:18", "text": "幸运的。如果我造成更多伤害，我可能会得到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14720.51, "timestamp": "04:05:20", "text": "好的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14725.67, "timestamp": "04:05:25", "text": "镜片。我希望我能做出最大的贡献。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14728.75, "timestamp": "04:05:28", "text": "我想做到最好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14748.94, "timestamp": "04:05:48", "text": "那。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14750.11, "timestamp": "04:05:50", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14753.189, "timestamp": "04:05:53", "text": "你好。它为什么要去那里？哦，那个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14756.79, "timestamp": "04:05:56", "text": "此人当时也在自动运行中。我看见你。"}]